---
import MoldRemediationLayout from '../../layouts/MoldRemediationLayout.astro';
---

<MoldRemediationLayout>
    <!-- Hero Section -->
    <header class="relative w-full py-12 lg:py-20 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 max-w-[1280px] mx-auto">
        <div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row gap-12 items-center">
            <!-- Content -->
            <div class="flex-1 flex flex-col gap-6 text-center lg:text-left">
                <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-[#11d4c4]/10 text-[#11d4c4] text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider w-fit mx-auto lg:mx-0">
                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-base">verified_user</span>
                    Trusted & Insured
                </div>
                <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-black text-[#0f172a] leading-[1.1] tracking-tight">
                    Professional Mold Remediation & <span class="text-[#11d4c4]">Air Quality Solutions</span>
                </h1>
                <p class="text-lg text-slate-600 leading-relaxed max-w-2xl mx-auto lg:mx-0">
                    Don't let hidden mold compromise your health. We provide professional testing, scientific remediation, and humidity control to restore healthy air to your Florida home.
                </p>
                <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center lg:justify-start gap-4 pt-2">
                    <button class="bg-[#11d4c4] hover:bg-teal-400 text-[#0f172a] px-6 py-3.5 rounded-lg font-bold text-base transition-colors flex items-center gap-2 shadow-lg shadow-[#11d4c4]/20">
                        <span class="material-symbols-outlined">calendar_month</span>
                        Schedule Inspection
                    </button>
                    <button class="bg-white border-2 border-slate-200 hover:border-[#11d4c4] text-slate-700 hover:text-[#11d4c4] px-6 py-3.5 rounded-lg font-bold text-base transition-all flex items-center gap-2">
                        <span class="material-symbols-outlined">school</span>
                        Black Mold Education
                    </button>
                </div>
                <div class="flex items-center justify-center lg:justify-start gap-6 pt-4 text-xs font-medium text-slate-400">

                    <div class="flex items-center gap-1">
                        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[#11d4c4] text-base">check_circle</span>
                        Specialized Team
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-1">
                        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[#11d4c4] text-base">check_circle</span>
                        24/7 Response
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <!-- Image -->
            <div class="flex-1 w-full max-w-[600px] lg:max-w-none">
                <div class="relative rounded-2xl overflow-hidden aspect-[4/3] shadow-2xl shadow-slate-200">
                    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-tr from-[#11d4c4]/20 to-transparent z-10"></div>
                    <img alt="Mold Inspection Professional" class="w-full h-full object-cover" data-alt="Scientific air quality testing professional with equipment in a clean home environment" src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuDep2FTyFF8p35UqmyUMPhpQ-N89mTKlJAi4TZ6zZYWBwQVmGDrtQv5ZGBl0cGLYxQ_XWM4HmjIfnZg1MMiC3Qaq2ryv8r9u8TtY1xP7rVoA3amNg31o2x3bZ25jiZ6_mH6mt7nnMAEzDYcvlPwMY4Uin6r0YgZs8ENNa4uGENyGSihybe94IIKb8gPBY5oFrZv1FiYzRtG9OyXubfaClgXWiE1XJAIQxElz5fNWitK1wuqC4nZCnAumJDnYqAP86BXVzGsicr12lk8"/>
                    <!-- Floating Badge -->
                    <div class="absolute bottom-6 left-6 z-20 bg-white/95 backdrop-blur px-4 py-3 rounded-lg shadow-lg flex items-center gap-3 border border-slate-100">
                        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-green-100 flex items-center justify-center text-green-600">
                            <span class="material-symbols-outlined">health_and_safety</span>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 font-semibold uppercase">Air Quality Status</p>
                            <p class="text-sm font-bold text-[#0f172a]">Restored to Healthy Levels</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Mold Lifecycle Bento Grid -->
    <section class="py-16 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 bg-white border-y border-slate-100">
        <div class="max-w-[1280px] mx-auto">
            <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-12">
                <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-[#0f172a] mb-4">Complete Mold Defense Strategy</h2>
                <p class="text-slate-600">Our scientific approach moves beyond simple cleaning. We identify the source, contain the spread, and engineer a permanent solution.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
                <!-- Step 1: Assess -->
                <article class="group relative flex flex-col p-6 rounded-xl bg-[#f6f8f8] border border-slate-200 hover:border-[#11d4c4] transition-colors">
                    <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-blue-100 text-blue-600 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-4 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
                        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-2xl">biotech</span>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-[#0f172a] mb-2">1. Assess</h3>
                    <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 mb-4 flex-grow">Inspection & Testing. Microscopic analysis to identify mold types and spore counts.</p>
                    <a class="text-sm font-bold text-blue-600 flex items-center gap-1 group-hover:gap-2 transition-all" href="/restoration/mold-testing/">
                        Testing Process <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm">arrow_forward</span>
                    </a>
                </article>
                <!-- Step 2: Contain -->
                <article class="group relative flex flex-col p-6 rounded-xl bg-[#f6f8f8] border border-slate-200 hover:border-[#11d4c4] transition-colors">
                    <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-amber-100 text-amber-600 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-4 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
                        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-2xl">security</span>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-[#0f172a] mb-2">2. Contain</h3>
                    <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 mb-4 flex-grow">Safety Barriers. HEPA filtration and negative air pressure to stop spore spread.</p>
                    <a class="text-sm font-bold text-amber-600 flex items-center gap-1 group-hover:gap-2 transition-all" href="/our-process/">
                        Containment Tech <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm">arrow_forward</span>
                    </a>
                </article>
                <!-- Step 3: Remediate -->
                <article class="group relative flex flex-col p-6 rounded-xl bg-[#f6f8f8] border border-slate-200 hover:border-[#11d4c4] transition-colors">
                    <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-[#11d4c4]/20 text-[#11d4c4] rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-4 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
                        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-2xl">cleaning_services</span>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-[#0f172a] mb-2">3. Remediate</h3>
                    <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 mb-4 flex-grow">Removal & Sanitize. Professional removal of affected materials and chemical sanitation.</p>
                    <a class="text-sm font-bold text-[#11d4c4] flex items-center gap-1 group-hover:gap-2 transition-all" href="/our-process/">
                        Remediation Steps <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm">arrow_forward</span>
                    </a>
                </article>
                <!-- Step 4: Prevent -->
                <article class="group relative flex flex-col p-6 rounded-xl bg-[#f6f8f8] border border-slate-200 hover:border-[#11d4c4] transition-colors">
                    <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-green-100 text-green-600 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-4 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
                        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-2xl">water_drop</span>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-[#0f172a] mb-2">4. Prevent</h3>
                    <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 mb-4 flex-grow">Humidity Control. Moisture management systems to stop future colony growth.</p>
                    <a class="text-sm font-bold text-green-600 flex items-center gap-1 group-hover:gap-2 transition-all" href="/contact/">
                        Prevention Systems <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm">arrow_forward</span>
                    </a>
                </article>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Hidden Dangers & Florida Context -->
    <section class="py-16 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 max-w-[1280px] mx-auto">
        <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12">
            <!-- Hidden Dangers -->
            <div class="flex flex-col gap-6">
                <div class="mb-2">
                    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#0f172a] mb-2">Hidden Dangers: Signals in Your Home</h2>
                    <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm">Mold isn't always visible. Watch for these silent indicators.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
                    <!-- Health Signals -->
                    <div class="bg-red-50 border border-red-100 rounded-xl p-5">
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3 text-red-700 font-bold">
                            <span class="material-symbols-outlined">medical_services</span>
                            Health Signals
                        </div>
                        <ul class="space-y-2">
                            <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-700">
                                <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-red-400 mt-1.5"></span>
                                Persistent coughing or sneezing
                            </li>
                            <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-700">
                                <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-red-400 mt-1.5"></span>
                                Unexplained headaches
                            </li>
                            <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-700">
                                <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-red-400 mt-1.5"></span>
                                Eye or skin irritation
                            </li>
                            <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-700">
                                <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-red-400 mt-1.5"></span>
                                Worsening asthma symptoms
                            </li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                    <!-- House Signals -->
                    <div class="bg-orange-50 border border-orange-100 rounded-xl p-5">
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3 text-orange-700 font-bold">
                            <span class="material-symbols-outlined">home_work</span>
                            House Signals
                        </div>
                        <ul class="space-y-2">
                            <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-700">
                                <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-orange-400 mt-1.5"></span>
                                Musty, earthy odors
                            </li>
                            <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-700">
                                <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-orange-400 mt-1.5"></span>
                                Peeling wallpaper or paint
                            </li>
                            <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-700">
                                <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-orange-400 mt-1.5"></span>
                                Dark grout in showers
                            </li>
                            <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-700">
                                <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-orange-400 mt-1.5"></span>
                                Water stains on ceilings
                            </li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <!-- Florida Context -->
            <div class="relative bg-[#0f172a] rounded-xl p-8 overflow-hidden flex flex-col justify-between min-h-[300px]">
                <!-- Abstract Map Pattern -->
                <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-10" style="background-image: radial-gradient(#11d4c4 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 20px 20px;"></div>
                <div class="relative z-10">
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-[#11d4c4] mb-4 font-bold tracking-wide uppercase text-xs">
                        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-lg">location_on</span>
                        Florida-Specific Context
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4">Why Florida Mold is Different</h3>
                    <p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-6">
                        Florida's average humidity of 74% creates the perfect breeding ground for aggressive mold strains. Standard cleaning isn't enough—you need humidity control systems designed for our sub-tropical climate.
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div class="relative z-10 p-4 bg-white/10 backdrop-blur rounded-lg border border-white/10">
                    <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
                        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[#11d4c4] mt-1">gavel</span>
                        <div>
                            <h4 class="text-white font-bold text-sm">Insurance Claims Assistance</h4>
                            <p class="text-slate-300 text-xs mt-1">We navigate Florida property insurance policies to help document damage and file your claim correctly.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Services Cluster & FAQ -->
    <section class="py-16 bg-white border-t border-slate-100">
        <div class="max-w-[1280px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
            <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-3 gap-12">
                <!-- Services Cluster -->
                <div class="lg:col-span-1">
                    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#0f172a] mb-6">Specialized Services</h3>
                    <div class="flex flex-col gap-2">
                        <a href="/restoration/mold-remediation/" class="group flex items-center justify-between p-3 rounded-lg hover:bg-[#f6f8f8] transition-colors border border-transparent hover:border-slate-100">
                            <span class="text-slate-700 font-medium group-hover:text-[#11d4c4] transition-colors">Black Mold Removal</span>
                            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-slate-300 group-hover:text-[#11d4c4]">chevron_right</span>
                        </a>
                        <a href="/restoration/mold-remediation/" class="group flex items-center justify-between p-3 rounded-lg hover:bg-[#f6f8f8] transition-colors border border-transparent hover:border-slate-100">
                            <span class="text-slate-700 font-medium group-hover:text-[#11d4c4] transition-colors">Attic & Crawlspace Remediation</span>
                            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-slate-300 group-hover:text-[#11d4c4]">chevron_right</span>
                        </a>
                        <a href="/restoration/mold-remediation/" class="group flex items-center justify-between p-3 rounded-lg hover:bg-[#f6f8f8] transition-colors border border-transparent hover:border-slate-100">
                            <span class="text-slate-700 font-medium group-hover:text-[#11d4c4] transition-colors">HVAC & Duct Cleaning</span>
                            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-slate-300 group-hover:text-[#11d4c4]">chevron_right</span>
                        </a>
                        <a href="/restoration/water-damage/" class="group flex items-center justify-between p-3 rounded-lg hover:bg-[#f6f8f8] transition-colors border border-transparent hover:border-slate-100">
                            <span class="text-slate-700 font-medium group-hover:text-[#11d4c4] transition-colors">Water Damage Restoration</span>
                            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-slate-300 group-hover:text-[#11d4c4]">chevron_right</span>
                        </a>
                        <a href="/commercial/" class="group flex items-center justify-between p-3 rounded-lg hover:bg-[#f6f8f8] transition-colors border border-transparent hover:border-slate-100">
                            <span class="text-slate-700 font-medium group-hover:text-[#11d4c4] transition-colors">Commercial Sanitization</span>
                            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-slate-300 group-hover:text-[#11d4c4]">chevron_right</span>
                        </a>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <!-- FAQ -->
                <div class="lg:col-span-2">
                    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#0f172a] mb-6">Frequently Asked Questions</h3>
                    <div class="flex flex-col gap-4">
                        <details class="group bg-[#f6f8f8] rounded-lg">
                            <summary class="flex items-center justify-between p-4 cursor-pointer font-semibold text-slate-800 list-none">
                                <span>Can I just clean mold with bleach?</span>
                                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-slate-400 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform">expand_more</span>
                            </summary>
                            <div class="px-4 pb-4 text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                                No. Bleach only kills surface mold on non-porous materials. On porous surfaces like drywall or wood, the roots remain, and the moisture in bleach can actually feed future growth. Professional remediation removes the root structure physically.
                            </div>
                        </details>
                        <details class="group bg-[#f6f8f8] rounded-lg">
                            <summary class="flex items-center justify-between p-4 cursor-pointer font-semibold text-slate-800 list-none">
                                <span>How much does mold remediation cost?</span>
                                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-slate-400 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform">expand_more</span>
                            </summary>
                            <div class="px-4 pb-4 text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                                Costs vary significantly based on the scope of damage. A small localized treatment might start around $500, while extensive structural remediation can be several thousand. We provide transparent, itemized estimates after the initial assessment.
                            </div>
                        </details>
                        <details class="group bg-[#f6f8f8] rounded-lg">
                            <summary class="flex items-center justify-between p-4 cursor-pointer font-semibold text-slate-800 list-none">
                                <span>Is mold covered by homeowners insurance in Florida?</span>
                                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-slate-400 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform">expand_more</span>
                            </summary>
                            <div class="px-4 pb-4 text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                                It depends on the cause. If the mold results from a covered "peril" like a sudden pipe burst, it is often covered up to policy limits. Gradual negligence is usually not. We can help you understand your policy's coverage.
                            </div>
                        </details>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
</MoldRemediationLayout>
